<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Spice Garden Restaurant</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#111;
    color:white;
}

header{
    background:#000;
    padding:20px 8%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
}

.logo{
    color:orange;
    font-size:28px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin-left:20px;
}

.hero{
    height:90vh;
    background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?q=80&w=1200')
    center/cover;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
}

.hero-content{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    padding:40px;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:60px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero p{
    font-size:20px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.btn{
    background:orange;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 25px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:5px;
}

section{
    padding:70px 8%;
}

.section-title{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:40px;
    color:orange;
    font-size:40px;
}

.about{
    text-align:center;
    max-width:800px;
    margin:auto;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.menu-container{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.menu-item{
    background:#222;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-align:center;
}

.menu-item img{
    width:100%;
    height:200px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.menu-item h3{
    margin-top:15px;
}

.price{
    color:orange;
    font-size:20px;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.review-container{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.review{
    background:#222;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.contact{
    text-align:center;
}

footer{
    background:#000;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">Spice Garden</div>

    <nav>
        #aboutAbout</a>
        #menuMenu</a>
        #reviewsReviews</a>
        #contactContact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Welcome to Spice Garden</h1>
    <p>Delicious Food • Great Ambience • Best Experience</p>
    #menuView Menu</a>
</div>

</section>

<section id="about">
<h2 class="section-title">About Us</h2>

<div class="about">
    <p>
        Spice Garden is a modern restaurant serving fresh,
        delicious and high-quality food. We combine traditional
        flavours with modern cooking techniques to create
        unforgettable dining experiences.
    </p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="menu">
<h2 class="section-title">Our Menu</h2>

<div class="menu-container">

<div class="menu-item">
https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ca4e?q=80&w=800
<h3>Pizza</h3>
<p>Cheesy and delicious pizza.</p>
<div class="price">?299</div>
</div>

<div class="menu-item">
https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568901346375-23c9450c58cd?q=80&w=800
<h3>Burger</h3>
<p>Fresh and juicy burger.</p>
<div class="price">?149</div>
</div>

<div class="menu-item">
https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621996346565-e3dbc646d9a9?q=80&w=800
<h3>Pasta</h3>
<p>Creamy Italian pasta.</p>
<div class="price">?249</div>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="reviews">
<h2 class="section-title">Customer Reviews</h2>

<div class="review-container">

<div class="review">
????? <br><br>
Amazing food and very friendly staff.
</div>

<div class="review">
????? <br><br>
Best restaurant in town. Highly recommended.
</div>

<div class="review">
????? <br><br>
Loved the ambience and quality of food.
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>

<div class="contact">
<p>?? Jodhpur, Rajasthan</p><br>
<p>?? +91 9876543210</p><br>
<p>?? info@spicegarden.com</p>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
    Demo Project Created For Portfolio Purpose
</footer>

</body>
</html>